comment:
Inspectors observed the following non-food-contact surfaces that need to be cleaned at more frequency:
(a) the bottom of the dry storage small cube reach-in freezer had an accumulation of chicken and pretzels;
(b) the undersides of the soda fountain; 
(c) the underside of the coffee maker basket.
PIC was informed and a plan was made to clean these areas more frequently to prevent the accumulation of soil residues.
